TerraTorch
----------
Copyright contributors to the Terratorch project

AUREON's aureon/legacy_reference.py adapts the learned pyramid layer layout
and forward ordering from TerraTorch's UperNetDecoder at commit
948b5535092f847e1ddc90e3f7ef7a67094725c0. AUREON adds validation, lazy
registration, and a subclass that delegates the UPerNet core to the
separately installed TerraTorch package. The upstream decoder states that
it was adapted from MMSegmentation; that ancestry is acknowledged here.

AUREON's checkpoint migration is informed by TerraTorch commit
89a3ed13d7a6272c009c4c5fbabf62461fcfb16c and its legacy-scale migration tests.

KAO-TerraMind
-------------
Author: Teerapong Panboonyuen
KAO-TerraMind (A, B, C): copyright 2026 Teerapong Panboonyuen, as stated in
the upstream project README.

The Sentinel-2 normalization constants, band ordering and class taxonomy
used in aureon/catalog.py and aureon/recipe.py come from the published
KAO-TerraMind C inference helper at revision
4e7252d3c83b3e877744da214005184a4133883f. AUREON supplies its own bounded
tiling, validation and serving implementations. The helper identifies the
normalization values as TerraMind S2L2A pre-training statistics.

