TerraMind generation integration
-------------------------------
The candidate integrates separately installed TerraTorch 1.2.13 TerraMind
generation and S1GRD tokenizer implementations. TerraTorch contributors retain
their attribution. The reviewed installed 37-file source hashes are recorded
in aureon/terramind_native/upstream-source.json. AUREON adds strict local
loading, request isolation, unchanged-conditioning reuse, guarded denoiser
capture and synthetic geospatial delivery. No model/tokenizer weights or
upstream runtime source are bundled by this integration.
